{"id":"03defc006c104890","group":"72","path":"72/72-df-applicative-term-evaluation.md","title":"部分应用结构的项与求值","display":"df-applicative-term-evaluation — 部分应用结构的项与求值","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Handbook of Proof Theory","book_abbrev":"72","label":"72-df-applicative-term-evaluation","aliases":["72-df-applicative-term-evaluation"],"display":"df-applicative-term-evaluation — 部分应用结构的项与求值","depends_on":[],"chapter":"VI","source_edition":"Buss (ed.), Handbook of Proof Theory, Elsevier, 1998","source_location":"Ch.VI §§1.3,2.2, print409–410,423/PDF421–422,435; explicit external semantics","source_kind":"source-based-local-formalization","verification_status":"source-statement-and-local-contract-reviewed; not-machine-checked","proof_status":"finite-tree recursion and single-valuedness checked","eligible_as_verified_dependency":false,"created":"2026-10-22","revision_round":"2026-10-22-expansion"},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Handbook of Proof Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"72"},{"key":"label","html":"72-df-applicative-term-evaluation"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>72-df-applicative-term-evaluation</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-applicative-term-evaluation — 部分应用结构的项与求值"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<span class=\"property-null\">无</span>"},{"key":"chapter","html":"VI"},{"key":"source_edition","html":"Buss (ed.), Handbook of Proof Theory, Elsevier, 1998"},{"key":"source_location","html":"Ch.VI §§1.3,2.2, print409–410,423/PDF421–422,435; explicit external semantics"},{"key":"source_kind","html":"source-based-local-formalization"},{"key":"verification_status","html":"source-statement-and-local-contract-reviewed; not-machine-checked"},{"key":"proof_status","html":"finite-tree recursion and single-valuedness checked"},{"key":"eligible_as_verified_dependency","html":"false"},{"key":"created","html":"2026-10-22"},{"key":"revision_round","html":"2026-10-22-expansion"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>ZFC 中固定非空集合 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"X\">\\(X\\)</span>，以及 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"G\\subseteq X^3\">\\(G\\subseteq X^3\\)</span>，满足 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\langle a,b,c\\rangle,\\langle a,b,d\\rangle\\in G\\Rightarrow c=d\">\\(\\langle a,b,c\\rangle,\\langle a,b,d\\rangle\\in G\\Rightarrow c=d\\)</span>。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\eta:\\omega\\to X\">\\(\\eta:\\omega\\to X\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"i\\in\\omega\">\\(i\\in\\omega\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"a,b\\in X\">\\(a,b\\in X\\)</span>。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"v_i,c_a,\\mathsf{ap}(t,u)\">\\(v_i,c_a,\\mathsf{ap}(t,u)\\)</span> 是标签互异的有限自由构造树，依次代表变量、常元和应用。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal T_X\">\\(\\mathcal T_X\\)</span> 由以下阶段构造；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"t,u\\in\\mathcal T_X\">\\(t,u\\in\\mathcal T_X\\)</span>。求值关系 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"E_G(t,\\eta,a)\">\\(E_G(t,\\eta,a)\\)</span> 按严格子树递归；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\simeq_{G,\\eta}\">\\(\\simeq_{G,\\eta}\\)</span> 比较两个部分项的完整输出图。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\begin{aligned}\nv_i&amp;:=\\langle0,i\\rangle,\\quad c_a:=\\langle1,a\\rangle,\\quad\n\\mathsf{ap}(t,u):=\\langle2,\\langle t,u\\rangle\\rangle,\\\\\nT_0&amp;:=\\{v_i:i\\in\\omega\\}\\cup\\{c_a:a\\in X\\},\\\\\nT_{n+1}&amp;:=T_n\\cup\\{\\mathsf{ap}(t,u):t,u\\in T_n\\},\\quad\\mathcal T_X:=\\bigcup_{n\\in\\omega}T_n,\\\\\nE_G(v_i,\\eta,a)&amp;:\\Longleftrightarrow a=\\eta(i),\\quad E_G(c_b,\\eta,a):\\Longleftrightarrow a=b,\\\\\nE_G(\\mathsf{ap}(t,u),\\eta,a)&amp;:\\Longleftrightarrow\\exists b,c\\in X\\ (E_G(t,\\eta,b)\\land E_G(u,\\eta,c)\\land\\langle b,c,a\\rangle\\in G),\\\\\nt\\downarrow_{G,\\eta}&amp;:\\Longleftrightarrow\\exists a\\in X\\ E_G(t,\\eta,a),\\\\\nt\\simeq_{G,\\eta}u&amp;:\\Longleftrightarrow\\forall a\\in X\\ (E_G(t,\\eta,a)\\leftrightarrow E_G(u,\\eta,a)).\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\begin{aligned}\nv_i&amp;:=\\langle0,i\\rangle,\\quad c_a:=\\langle1,a\\rangle,\\quad\n\\mathsf{ap}(t,u):=\\langle2,\\langle t,u\\rangle\\rangle,\\\\\nT_0&amp;:=\\{v_i:i\\in\\omega\\}\\cup\\{c_a:a\\in X\\},\\\\\nT_{n+1}&amp;:=T_n\\cup\\{\\mathsf{ap}(t,u):t,u\\in T_n\\},\\quad\\mathcal T_X:=\\bigcup_{n\\in\\omega}T_n,\\\\\nE_G(v_i,\\eta,a)&amp;:\\Longleftrightarrow a=\\eta(i),\\quad E_G(c_b,\\eta,a):\\Longleftrightarrow a=b,\\\\\nE_G(\\mathsf{ap}(t,u),\\eta,a)&amp;:\\Longleftrightarrow\\exists b,c\\in X\\ (E_G(t,\\eta,b)\\land E_G(u,\\eta,c)\\land\\langle b,c,a\\rangle\\in G),\\\\\nt\\downarrow_{G,\\eta}&amp;:\\Longleftrightarrow\\exists a\\in X\\ E_G(t,\\eta,a),\\\\\nt\\simeq_{G,\\eta}u&amp;:\\Longleftrightarrow\\forall a\\in X\\ (E_G(t,\\eta,a)\\leftrightarrow E_G(u,\\eta,a)).\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>求值仅调用严格子项；G 单值使每个项至多有一个值。Kleene 相等允许两个项同时无值，不把无值项当作 X 的新元素。本接口是原书部分项语言的外部集合语义，未宣称给出 APP 的全部公理或内部演算。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[],"attachments":[],"math":[{"tex":"X","display":false},{"tex":"G\\subseteq X^3","display":false},{"tex":"\\langle a,b,c\\rangle,\\langle a,b,d\\rangle\\in G\\Rightarrow c=d","display":false},{"tex":"\\eta:\\omega\\to X","display":false},{"tex":"i\\in\\omega","display":false},{"tex":"a,b\\in X","display":false},{"tex":"v_i,c_a,\\mathsf{ap}(t,u)","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathcal T_X","display":false},{"tex":"t,u\\in\\mathcal T_X","display":false},{"tex":"E_G(t,\\eta,a)","display":false},{"tex":"\\simeq_{G,\\eta}","display":false},{"tex":"\\begin{aligned}\nv_i&:=\\langle0,i\\rangle,\\quad c_a:=\\langle1,a\\rangle,\\quad\n\\mathsf{ap}(t,u):=\\langle2,\\langle t,u\\rangle\\rangle,\\\\\nT_0&:=\\{v_i:i\\in\\omega\\}\\cup\\{c_a:a\\in X\\},\\\\\nT_{n+1}&:=T_n\\cup\\{\\mathsf{ap}(t,u):t,u\\in T_n\\},\\quad\\mathcal T_X:=\\bigcup_{n\\in\\omega}T_n,\\\\\nE_G(v_i,\\eta,a)&:\\Longleftrightarrow a=\\eta(i),\\quad E_G(c_b,\\eta,a):\\Longleftrightarrow a=b,\\\\\nE_G(\\mathsf{ap}(t,u),\\eta,a)&:\\Longleftrightarrow\\exists b,c\\in X\\ (E_G(t,\\eta,b)\\land E_G(u,\\eta,c)\\land\\langle b,c,a\\rangle\\in G),\\\\\nt\\downarrow_{G,\\eta}&:\\Longleftrightarrow\\exists a\\in X\\ E_G(t,\\eta,a),\\\\\nt\\simeq_{G,\\eta}u&:\\Longleftrightarrow\\forall a\\in X\\ (E_G(t,\\eta,a)\\leftrightarrow E_G(u,\\eta,a)).\n\\end{aligned}","display":true}],"bytes":2280,"backlinks":[{"id":"d556225e5f2719e3","anchor":"ref-1","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"e6c99e2646691c7d","anchor":"ref-136","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"VI章新增15项：[[72-df-applicative-term-evaluation]] · [[72-df-baire-neighborhood-function]] · [[72-df-combinatory-bracket-abstraction]] · [[72-df-hereditarily-effective-operations]] · [[72-df-hereditarily-recursive-operations]] · [[72-df-modified-realizability-full-model]] · [[72-df-modified-realizer-type]] · [[72-df-partial-combinatory-algebra]] · [[72-df-realizer-finite-types]] · [[72-thm-combinatory-abstraction-beta]] · [[72-thm-heo-partial-equivalence]] · [[72-thm-kleene-first-pca]] · [[72-thm-modified-realizability-full-truth]] · [[72-thm-modified-realizability-witness]] · [[72-thm-neighborhood-function-continuity]]"},{"id":"00439897fba390aa","anchor":"ref-510","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"VI章新增15项：[[72-df-applicative-term-evaluation]] · [[72-df-baire-neighborhood-function]] · [[72-df-combinatory-bracket-abstraction]] · [[72-df-hereditarily-effective-operations]] · [[72-df-hereditarily-recursive-operations]] · [[72-df-modified-realizability-full-model]] · [[72-df-modified-realize